CiukiOS f6-14 Amendment 1: upstream fixes and bounded offline admission.
Applied after 0001-offline-sdk.patch; pinned originals stay unchanged.
Reasons: short data MIME underflow; parser/construction admission before
normalization; shared GIF/bitmap auxiliary memory ledger and frame cap;
layout deadlines on min/max and plain text, including rejected timings;
non-clicking input cancellation; successful top-level completion notification.
Primary references and host evidence: docs/validation/netsurf-m1-amendment-1.md.

